msgid "title"
msgstr "Titel"

#: models/config.py:210
msgid "text"
msgstr "Text"

#: models/config.py:215
msgid "canned reply"
msgstr "Textbaustein"

#: models/config.py:216
msgid "canned replies"
msgstr "Textbausteine"

#: models/config.py:224
msgid "auto-close after (days)"
msgstr "Automatisch schließen nach (Tagen)"

#: models/config.py:227
msgid ""
"Tickets waiting for the requester are closed automatically after this many "
"days without a reply."
msgstr ""
"Tickets, die auf den Ersteller warten, werden nach so vielen Tagen ohne "
"Antwort automatisch geschlossen."

#: models/config.py:230
msgid "warn before auto-close (hours)"
msgstr "Warnen vor automatischem Schließen (Stunden)"

#: models/config.py:232
msgid ""
"The requester and the assignee are warned this many hours before a ticket "
"closes automatically."
msgstr ""
"Ersteller und Bearbeiter werden so viele Stunden vor dem automatischen "
"Schließen eines Tickets gewarnt."

#: models/config.py:235
msgid "requester can reopen for (days)"
msgstr "Ersteller kann wieder öffnen für (Tage)"

#: models/config.py:237
msgid ""
"For this many days after closing, the requester can reopen the ticket. Staff"
" can always reopen."
msgstr ""
"So viele Tage nach dem Schließen kann der Ersteller das Ticket wieder "
"öffnen. Das Team kann es immer wieder öffnen."

#: models/config.py:240
msgid "open tickets per person"
msgstr "Offene Tickets pro Person"

#: models/config.py:243
msgid ""
"A person cannot submit a new ticket while this many of their tickets are "
"still open."
msgstr ""
"Eine Person kann kein neues Ticket einreichen, solange so viele ihrer "
"Tickets noch offen sind."

#: models/config.py:246
msgid "maximum image size (MB)"
msgstr "Maximale Bildgröße (MB)"

#: models/config.py:249
msgid "delete images after (days)"
msgstr "Bilder löschen nach (Tagen)"

#: models/config.py:252
msgid ""
"Images of tickets closed longer than this are deleted. Leave empty to keep "
"them forever."
msgstr ""
"Bilder von Tickets, die länger als dies geschlossen sind, werden gelöscht. "
"Leer lassen, um sie dauerhaft zu behalten."

#: models/config.py:255 models/config.py:270 templates/aa_ticket/prefs.html:13
msgid "Discord direct messages"
msgstr "Discord-Direktnachrichten"

#: models/config.py:257
msgid ""
"When on and aa-discordbot is installed, people also get notifications as "
